==Description==
The '''Santa Nametag''' is an {{Color|Exclusive}} nametag which was originally meant to be obtained from the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]], but was scrapped and then left unused.

The '''Santa Nametag''' is very similar to the [[Default Nametag]], as it has white text and a black outline. However, it also has various Christmas emojis appear around it, floating up into the air. These include Santa, presents and Christmas trees.

